{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0999aa9dc5a833d89be","chatId":"b36bf5900b0a48d2bc8f76e36b914b37","sessionId":null,"userId":98169,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2549,"promptTokens":1652,"completionTokens":246,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:18:49"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068493313170528,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0999aa9dc5a833d89bc","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482329331,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:18:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0999aa9dc5a833d89bc","chatId":"b36bf5900b0a48d2bc8f76e36b914b37","sessionId":null,"userId":98169,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n今天的物理考试很难。不过，由于准备充分，我在很短的时间内就回答了考试中的大部分问题，并对自己的答案很有把握。但是当我答到最后一题时，我却怎么也想不出解题思路，结果考试剩下的时间都花在了这道题上。当我走出考场刚要和朋友讨论问题时，我突然想出了答案。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，我最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 悔恨 & 释怀 & 自豪\nB) 悔恨 & 释怀 & 气恼\nC) 气恼 & 愧疚 & 紧张\nD) 释怀 & 自豪 & 紧张\nE) 悔恨 & 气恼 & 自豪\nF) 悔恨 & 自豪 & 紧张\n\n## 问题 2\n我为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 我的朋友们也无法解决这个问题 & 我在考试期间浪费了时间 & 我没有准备得足够好。\nB) 我有能力解这道题，但在考试的时候却没有想到 & 我想到了问题的答案 & 我在考试结束后才想到答案\nC) 我能提前完成考试 & 我对我的答案感到不确定 & 我没有准备得足够好。\nD) 我在解决最后一个问题时遇到困难 & 我的朋友们也无法解决这个问题 & 我没有准备得足够好。\nE) 我在解决最后一个问题时遇到困难 & 我意识到我通过了考试 & 我的朋友们也无法解决这个问题\nF) 我想到了问题的答案 & 我在考试结束后才想到答案 & 我对我的答案感到不确定","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068493313170528,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0999aa9dc5a833d89be","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482329328,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:18:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"4a6011a903d546b9897527a9ed703a46"}